# Context7 documentation protocol (mandatory when available)

Before writing or changing **JUCE classes**, **`juce_add_plugin`**, `juce::dsp`, **APVTS**, or **WebBrowserComponent** (WebView2):

1. Invoke **Context7** (`use context7` / Context7 MCP) for the exact JUCE 8 signature — do not guess APIs from memory.
2. Cross-check CMake targets and MSVC flags against live JUCE 8 CMake docs.
3. If Context7 is unavailable, read `starter-cpp/externals/JUCE` headers and `docs/dev/juce-cmake-windows-troubleshooting.md`.

Index house DSP: `Modules/TrapCoreDSP/`, `factory/drum-architecture/Source/ThreeLayerDrum.h`, lab identities under `*-drum-lab/Source/`.

